  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity NONBUDSUPPFINAID and P0053 for Orissa health sector support is a component of Orissa Health Sector Nutrition Programme (OHSNP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;69,500,000. It works in the following sector(s): Reproductive health care, Basic nutrition, Health personnel development, Malaria control.</narrative>
